# Build-context allowlist for THIS image only (BuildKit reads
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the root .dockerignore).
#
# The image builds from the repo root so its repo-relative imports (../../src,
# ../../api) resolve, but it copies four directories and one package.json. The
# root .dockerignore only drops node_modules and .git, which still leaves ~2.5 GB
# of dist/, public/, dist-lib/ and character-studio/ to stream into the daemon:
# enough to OOM the build (exit 144) on a dev machine or a Codespace, for files
# this Dockerfile never opens. Cloud Build trims its own upload via .gcloudignore;
# this is the same trimming for a local `docker build`.
#
# Keep in sync with the COPY lines in Dockerfile.
*
!src/solana
!src/shared
!api/_lib
!workers/vanity-grinder
!workers/vanity-grinder/package.json

# Never ship run state or a local dep tree into the image.
**/node_modules
workers/vanity-grinder/out
